#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:12
#: 95938e70c37a4c95b1ee4ace94a0ed7d
msgid "System Features"
msgstr "系统特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:14
#: 5eb6370dea7f42999c052cd8f4cb31d6
msgid ""
"The Cube Orange autopilot is the latest and most powerful model in the "
"Cubepilot ecosystem. Designed for hobby users, commercial system integrators"
" and UAS manufacturers the Cube Orange autopilot is part of a wide ecosystem"
" of autopilot modules and carrier boards. All Cube models are compatible "
"with all carriers which allows users to choose an off the shelf carrier "
"board that best suits their needs. System designers are able to integrate "
"the Cube directly into their designs via published carrier board "
"specifications."
msgstr ""
"The Cube Orange 飞控是 Cubepilot 生态系统中最新、最强大的型号。专为业余用户、商业系统集成商和无人机制造商设计，Cube "
"Orange 飞控是飞控模块与载板广泛生态系统的一部分。所有 Cube "
"型号均与所有载板兼容，用户可选择最适合自己需求的现成载板。系统设计人员可通过发布的载板规格将 Cube 直接集成到其设计中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:16
#: be445efe223b45699de83e764656ebac
msgid ""
"The Cube Orange is available as a standalone module or as a package with a "
"new updated version of the original carrier board that now includes an "
"integrated ADS-B In module from uAvionics."
msgstr ""
"The Cube Orange 可作为独立模块提供，也可与原始载板新版本组合提供，该新版本现已集成来自 uAvionics 的 ADS-B In 模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:19
#: 32818c54b65a460f93cf2e01364f1a12
msgid "ADS-B Carrier Board"
msgstr "ADS-B 载板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:21
#: c2ff776a9e2e48628d3a4d965cfd2acb
msgid ""
"The new ADS-B carrier boards overall footprint is identical to the standard "
"versions and the main changes compared to the original carrier are as "
"follows:"
msgstr "新款 ADS-B 载板的整体尺寸与标准版本相同，与原始载板相比的主要变化如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:23
#: 85ab23fb1b97409f9bc8f342939c698a
msgid "Integration of uAvonix ADS-B IN Receiver on Serial 5"
msgstr "在 Serial 5 上集成 uAvonix ADS-B IN 接收机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:24
#: 4fb1f1f6fdb94dbd84153ff4f2136521
msgid "Built-In ADS-B Antenna"
msgstr "内置 ADS-B 天线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:25
#: eee30ec22c4e4399b80cd5e5d2441d15
msgid "Removal of Intel Edison Bay and Debug USB Ports"
msgstr "移除了 Intel Edison Bay 和调试 USB 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:27
#: 60f8186550ac4eefaf28063ab426bba2
msgid ""
"All other specification and external connections remain identical to the "
"original board as listed on the Cube Black page."
msgstr "所有其他规格和外部接口与 Cube Black 页面所列原始载板相同。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:30
#: dd5a715d2620452482b1f9d500c4b4e3
msgid "Cube Orange/+ Features"
msgstr "Cube Orange/+ 特性"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:32
#: 31bf9f4f667747b09d5cfcfa6fcce52d
msgid "Faster H7 SOC with 1MB ram"
msgstr "更快的 H7 SOC，配备 1MB RAM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:33
#: 241b5b5334ad4d99bf362af67e6fce42
msgid "Upgraded triple redundant IMU sensors for extra redundancy"
msgstr "升级的三重冗余 IMU 传感器，提供额外冗余"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:34
#: 2fb9d5a41c564ba18f4ecdbfd2a522d7
msgid ""
"2 sets of IMU are vibration-isolated mechanically, reducing the effect of "
"frame vibration to state estimation"
msgstr "2 组 IMU 通过机械减震隔离，降低机架震动对状态估计的影响"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:35
#: 9e48793d159740f6817924355dafe5ad
msgid ""
"IMUs are temperature-controlled by onboard heating resistors, allowing "
"optimum working temperature of IMUs"
msgstr "IMU 通过板载加热电阻进行温控，使 IMU 保持最佳工作温度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:36
#: 3d070270152844b2b2b493f168574c48
msgid ""
"The entire flight management unit(FMU) and inertial management unit(IMU) are"
" housed in a reatively small form factor (a cube)."
msgstr "整个飞行管理单元（FMU）和惯性管理单元（IMU）集成在相对小巧的外形（方块）中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-thecubeorange-overview.rst:37
#: f33b944816a3487bb5db48e7fb77eafa
msgid ""
"Fully Cubepilot carrierboard compatible, all inputs and outputs go through a"
" 80-pin DF17 connector, allowing a plug-in solution for manufacturers of "
"commercial systems. Manufacturers can design their own carrier boards to "
"suit their specific needs now and in the future."
msgstr ""
"与 Cubepilot 载板完全兼容，所有输入输出均通过 80 针 DF17 "
"连接器连接，为商业系统制造商提供即插即用方案。制造商可根据当前及未来的特定需求设计自己的载板。"

